    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Clash is a medieval multiplayer PVP game with 10 unique classes, each with their own abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the match starts, each player begins as the classic Knight class. From there, after every death, players either get to choose their next class, or have it assigned randomly (depends on match setting)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/046a66eef0ee40bbe29c468e04ce7955.poster.avif?t=1743851613\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/046a66eef0ee40bbe29c468e04ce7955.webm?t=1743851613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/046a66eef0ee40bbe29c468e04ce7955.mp4?t=1743851613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 10 medieval classes in the game, and they each have <strong>their own unique set of skills:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knight:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary: Sword Slash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondary: Shield\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTIMATE: Blitz</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/02d22e882a152abbe11adc2320494a83.avif?t=1743851613\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary: Bow &amp; Arrow Shot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondary: Bow Shove</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTIMATE: Ruthless</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/9526f0f79fd5de92f8aabe5c18bd9070.avif?t=1743851613\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary: Battleaxe Bludgeon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondary: Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTIMATE: Rage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/9654a4711670ba941634cb80ddf340cb.avif?t=1743851613\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizard:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary: Spell Cast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondary: Staff Shove</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTIMATE: Fireball</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/971c8563b8e640980bf95f9eb94582b3.avif?t=1743851613\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assassin:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary: Dagger Stab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondary: Double Dagger Strike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTIMATE: Cloak</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/d8792111e8b80feff7526bf2663f65ed.avif?t=1743851613\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swordmaster:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary: Katana Slash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondary: Katana Thrust</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTIMATE: Barrage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/e570e776bf06b82d52e27a7cbf497726.avif?t=1743851613\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spearman:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary: Spear Thrust</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondary: Spear Spin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTIMATE: Impale</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/09d301a9961ee82c1ecd60f8876db5c8.avif?t=1743851613\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arbalist:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary: Crossbow Bolt Shot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondary: Crossbow Shove</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTIMATE: Surge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/69c6c7487102c50884404bda158610a9.avif?t=1743851613\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farmer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary: Pitchfork Stab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondary: Charge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTIMATE: Stampede</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/3e7d19d3afe854ee3163605c7ce2d3b3.avif?t=1743851613\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miner:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary: Pickaxe Slash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondary: Pickaxe Slam</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTIMATE: Avalanche</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/acb06800c4edf9b6decd4ad913cb657c.avif?t=1743851613\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Battleground - 3 Maps!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/df5693e8e9d0010b087893fd01c4f0ab.avif?t=1743851613\" width=300 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/b5a27a68fa9144175bea319f9ef795d5.avif?t=1743851613\" width=300 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/5244750f7b55d87dfd8402c270f76053.avif?t=1743851613\" width=300 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather Choices - Spice up the visuals!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/1d4608de44fc7c1b9c8bca6e89409b6e.poster.avif?t=1743851613\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/1d4608de44fc7c1b9c8bca6e89409b6e.webm?t=1743851613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/1d4608de44fc7c1b9c8bca6e89409b6e.mp4?t=1743851613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toxic Emotes - Taunt with these classic medieval emotes, of course</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\